[[DECISION]] Decision for this turn, made by the platform: move redirect, help rung 0. Carry it out exactly. Skills in this package: explain, coach, practice, feedback, mock_interview, revision, study_plan. Offer and use no other skill.
[[MOVE-REDIRECT]] Kindly steer back to the course in one to three sentences. Teach nothing new in this reply."
